# =====================================================================
# imlate — 저장소 공통 무시 목록
# =====================================================================

# ---------------- 비밀 설정 (절대 커밋 금지) ----------------
config/application-secret.yml
**/config/application-secret.yml
application-secret.yml
!application-secret.yml.example
*.env
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets/
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.jks

# ---------------- Java / Gradle ----------------
build/
.gradle/
out/
*.class
*.jar
*.war
*.ear
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*
# Gradle wrapper jar 는 반드시 커밋한다 (위 *.jar 규칙의 예외)
!**/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar

# ---------------- Node / Frontend ----------------
node_modules/
dist/
dist-ssr/
.vite/
coverage/
.npm/
.pnpm-store/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# ---------------- Playwright ----------------
playwright-report/
test-results/
blob-report/
.playwright/

# ---------------- Terraform ----------------
# .terraform.lock.hcl 은 버전 고정을 위해 커밋한다.
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# ---------------- IDE ----------------
.idea/
*.iml
*.iws
*.ipr
.vscode/
!.vscode/extensions.json
.settings/
.classpath
.project
*.sublime-workspace

# ---------------- OS ----------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# ---------------- 기타 ----------------
logs/
*.log
tmp/
temp/
